title: "The exact punctured Walsh norm in six bits for all exponents"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Zhang
    given-names: Yongxian
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0000-3864-3536"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-11-27
repository-code: "https://github.com/mxym/math"
abstract: "Four explicit spectral branches determine the sharp six-bit punctured Walsh norm for all exponents, completing the six-bit interval left open in Martinevski’s Theorem 4.4. The proof is an abstract norm result with certified scalar transition intervals."
